cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Starpi in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Starpi"
abstract: "Knowledge assistant in the browser that shows how far each answer can be trusted: retrieval-augmented generation with verifiable citations, a deterministic source check that compares every statement with the excerpts it cites, and answer receipts that anyone can verify against the original files. Files are read on the device; answers come from WebGPU inference in a Web Worker, an own server or a cloud model."
